  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$6\\mathrm{CO_2}+6\\mathrm{H_2O}\\rightarrow\\mathrm{C_6H_{12}O_6}+6\\mathrm{O_2}$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "实际反应分多步进行。其中,水的氧化过程是一个重要环节,此过程在光系统II(简称PSII)中发生,使水氧化的活性中心是含有4个锰原子的配位簇(称为锰氧簇)。初始状态的锰氧簇(S0)在光照下依次失去电子变为S1、S2、S3和S4,氧化$\\mathrm{H_2O}$生成$\\mathrm{O_2}$。该过程简示如下:"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "caption": "锰氧簇氧化水的过程示意图(缺图)",
      "alt": "锰氧簇S0到S4的循环示意图",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000418-figure-001.jpg"
    }
  ],
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "part-000418-01",
      "label": "2-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "光合作用中,水的氧化是几个电子转移的过程?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000418-02",
      "label": "2-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$25^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$,标态下,下列电极反应的电极电势分别为"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\begin{array}{ll}\\text{(a)}\\mathrm{MnO_4^{3-}}+4\\mathrm{H^+}+\\mathrm{e^-}\\rightarrow\\mathrm{MnO_2}+2\\mathrm{H_2O} & E^\\ominus=2.90\\,\\mathrm{V}\\\\\\text{(b)}\\mathrm{MnO_2}+4\\mathrm{H^+}+\\mathrm{e^-}\\rightarrow\\mathrm{Mn^{3+}}+2\\mathrm{H_2O} & E^\\ominus=0.95\\,\\mathrm{V}\\\\\\text{(c)}\\mathrm{O_2}+4\\mathrm{H^+}+4\\mathrm{e^-}\\rightarrow2\\mathrm{H_2O} & E^\\ominus=1.23\\,\\mathrm{V}\\end{array}$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算上述半反应在中性条件下的电极电势。假定$\\mathrm{MnO_4^{3-}}$和$\\mathrm{Mn^{3+}}$的浓度均为$0.10\\,\\mathrm{mol\\,L^{-1}}$,氧分压等于其在空气中的分压。回答此条件下$\\mathrm{MnO_4^{3-}}$和$\\mathrm{MnO_2}$能否氧化水。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000418-03",
      "label": "2-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "在模拟锰氧簇的人工光合作用研究中,研究者注意到如下Mn(III)/Mn(II)体系(25 °C):"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$E^\\ominus=1.51\\,\\mathrm{V}$$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "在$[\\mathrm{H_2P_2O_7^{2-}}]=0.40\\,\\mathrm{mol\\,L^{-1}}$,$[\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_3^{3-}}]=[\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_2^{2-}}]$的溶液中:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\mathrm{(e)}\\;\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_3^{3-}}+2\\mathrm{H^+}+\\mathrm{e^-}\\rightarrow\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_2^{2-}}+\\mathrm{H_4P_2O_7}\\quad E=1.15\\,\\mathrm{V}$$"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000418-04",
      "label": "2-3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算(e)中的半反应的标准电极电势。($\\mathrm{H_4P_2O_7}$的酸解离常数:$K_{a1}=1.2\\times10^{-1}$,$K_{a2}=7.9\\times10^{-3}$,$K_{a3}=2.0\\times10^{-7}$,$K_{a4}=4.5\\times10^{-10}$)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "part-000418-05",
      "label": "2-3-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算$\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_2^{2-}}$和$\\mathrm{Mn(H_2P_2O_7)_3^{3-}}$的稳定常数之比。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
